son County record runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids April to May came in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 150% of normal in April to May but 45% in November to December. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 25% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 21469 had its driest year in 1963 at 58% of normal.</p>"}
